<title>FRANCE: Arthuis sees 1998 French growth of 2.5 percent.</title>
<headline>Arthuis sees 1998 French growth of 2.5 percent.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>French Finance Minister Jean Arthuis said on Thursday French economic growth would be 2.5 percent in 1998.</p>
<p>He gave the forecast to reporters during a regular weekly briefing. He did not elaborate.</p>
</text>
